---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<div id="left-intro">
<div id="intro-heading">
  Hi, I'm <span class="accent">Marina</span>,<br />
  a Senior <span class="accent">UX Writer</span> at Turnitin.<br />
  I specialize in <span class="accent">documentation</span>.
</div>
  <div id="intro-description">
    <p>I create clear, structured content that helps people understand and use complex systems. My work focuses on documentation and in-product content that supports usability at scale.</p>
    <p>Before UX writing, I worked in IT, supporting and documenting systems. That experience shapes how I approach documentation today—grounded in real user needs and practical problem-solving.</p>

  </div>
</div>

<div id="right-intro">
  <div id="intro-image">
    <Image src={avatar} alt="A graphic of Marina" />
  </div>
</div>
